    "text": "northernnewsnow.com\nwebsite\nDuluth\nDuluth business prepares for big year at Minnesota State Fair\nBy Sophia Lauber,\n4 hours agoDULUTH, Minn. (Northern News Now) - The team at Duluth-based BB and Friends is busy preparing inventory to bring to the Minnesota State Fair, their biggest event of the year. Co-owner Anna Bailey says they plan to sell over 100 large pieces of their wood mosaic art and thousands of other items.",
